# Allow-list: the image needs the source, the corpus, and the one index Phase 4 measured.
# Everything else stays out — above all infra/docker-compose.langfuse.yml, whose committed
# fixture credentials must never reach a deployed artifact (tests/test_deploy_guards.py).
*
!pyproject.toml
!LICENSE
!src/
!data/chunks_512.json
!data/metadata.json
!data/CORPUS.sha256
!data/INDEX.sha256
!data/indices/BGE_cs512.faiss
!data/indices/BGE_cs512_meta.pkl
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
